[[File:Map053.png|center|370px]]
'''Noodle Nirvana''' (理想郷ビバラメン ''Risōkyō Bibaramen'', '''Utopia Vivaramen''') is the 37th sub-chapter of [[Zero Legends]], and the 135th sub-chapter overall. It was introduced in [[Version 15.7 Update|Version 15.7]] and is available up to {{1c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
A moderately difficult sub-chapter that doesn't introduce any new enemies, so the difficulty comes from trait mixes rather than magnifications. [[Soup Stock Springs]] is by far the hardest stage, featuring a mixture of [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Alien]] and [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku enemies]], where [[Techn-Old Hyena]] and [[Wicked Face]] form a very strong backline while [[Mesocosmocyclone]] constantly warps your units straight into said backline. The rest of the sub-chapter is much easier, with [[Mass-Chashu-Sets]] being a straightforward push, [[Golden Gate Menma]] just being [[The Face]] backed by [[Ange Lackey]]s and [[Mini White Cyclone]]s, and [[Kernel Chaos]] being a relatively tame remake of [[Realm of Carnage (Deadly)|Realm of Carnage]] with only 2 [[Razorback]]s and 1 [[M. Ost]]. [[Fishcake Fortress]] is a [[Deathkory]] boss stage with [[Relic Doge]] and [[Fallen Bear]] spam that dies to [[:Category:Wave Shield Cats|Wave Shields]] and [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]]. Even the rematch with [[Inumusha]] in [[Bowl of Bliss]] is relatively tame compared to Soup Stock Springs.

